      "trackName": "Cadrage Director's Viewfinder",
      "releaseNotes": "Introducing Sun Tracking!\nCadrage can now display the sun's path for any date directly in the viewfinder. See exactly where the sun will rise, travel, and set at your location. To activate, tap the menu button in the lower left and select \"Sun\".\n\n As always, we'd love to hear your thoughts: support@cadrage.app",
